+\ body for bit 7 stops at it at once; before, it crossed the name, and a
+\ UTF-8 byte there (bit 7 set) was taken for the count byte - with bit 5,
+\ for a primitive's, and COMPILE, inlined garbage. The name is the len
+\ bytes before the nfa; the link ends just before the name.
 
